### PERF-003: Linear scan for user lookup on every login
**Severity:** High
**Location:** Line 27

**Evidence:** `users.find(u => u.email === email)` performs an O(n) linear scan through all users on every login request. Since the user list is read fresh from disk each time (line 26), there is no opportunity for caching or indexing.

