**Description:**

`eval()` is called directly on `req.body.expression`, which is entirely user-controlled. This is a textbook **Remote Code Execution (RCE)** vulnerability. An attacker can execute arbitrary server-side JavaScript with the full privileges of the Node.js process.

**Exploit Scenario:**

An attacker sends:

```http
POST /calculate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

