**Evidence:**

The `deepMerge` function (lines 1–11) iterates over `source` keys using `for...in` (line 2) and recursively assigns them to `target` without any check against dangerous prototype properties. On line 13, `req.body` (user-controlled input) is passed directly as the `source` argument:

```javascript
