This bypasses authentication entirely.

**Recommendation:** Escape all LDAP special characters (`*`, `(`, `)`, `\`, `NUL`) in user-supplied values before embedding them in filters, or use parameterized search with `javax.naming.directory.SearchControls` and filter arguments:

```java
