String filter = "(&(uid={0})(userPassword={1}))";
NamingEnumeration<?> results = ctx.search(BASE_DN, filter, new Object[]{username, password}, sc);
```

This causes the JNDI provider to escape the values according to RFC 2254, neutralizing injection.

